<% const asset = n => url_for('/images/eleme-pacman/' + n + '.webp'); %>
<article class="rb-case ep-case">
  <header class="rb-heading"><a class="case-back" href="<%- url_for(page.portfolio_home || '/visual-designer/') %>">← 返回作品集</a><div><p>ELE.ME / CHARACTER DESIGN</p><h1>饿了么×吃货卡吃豆人</h1><span class="rb-subtitle">IP 形象设计 · 三维角色 · 场景化传播</span></div></header>
  <div class="rb-image ep-wide"><img src="<%- asset('cover') %>" width="2560" height="1440" alt="蓝色吃豆人追逐金色吃货豆，搭配饿了么吃货卡标识" fetchpriority="high"></div>
  <div class="ep-intro"><div><span>PROJECT BACKGROUND / 项目背景</span><h2>让每一次收豆，<br>都有一个快乐的记忆点。</h2></div><div><p>717 吃货卡将奖励金积分转化为吃货豆，希望通过吃货豆的获取与使用增强用户粘性。围绕收豆玩法，设计具备品牌识别度的吃豆人形象，让积分互动更直观、更有趣。</p><p>从角色草图、形象方向与三维表现出发，将吃豆人延展到产品界面、线上线下海报及生活场景，建立连贯的吃货卡视觉记忆。</p><div class="ep-tags"><span>角色识别</span><span>收豆互动</span><span>场景延展</span></div></div></div>
  <nav class="dewu-chapter-nav rb-index" aria-label="吃豆人项目章节"><a href="#ep-character" class="active" aria-current="location"><span>01</span>形象探索</a><a href="#ep-rigging"><span>02</span>绑定与应用</a><a href="#ep-posters"><span>03</span>海报传播</a><a href="#ep-extension"><span>04</span>视觉延展</a></nav>
  <section class="rb-panel" id="ep-character"><header><div><p>01 / CHARACTER EXPLORATION</p><h2>从品牌线索，找到角色的性格。</h2><p class="rb-description">以外卖员、品牌 LOGO、吃豆人和外卖箱为四个探索方向，在轮廓、表情与配件中寻找辨识度。蓝色身体、大嘴与金色吃货豆逐步建立起“吃”的角色语言。</p></div></header><div class="ep-stack"><figure><img src="<%- asset('sketches') %>" width="4498" height="2532" alt="吃豆人前期草图：多种轮廓、表情、配件及配色探索" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>SKETCHES</span><h3>前期草图方案</h3></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="<%- asset('directions') %>" width="2600" height="1500" alt="外卖员、LOGO、吃豆人、外卖箱四类形象设计方向" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>DESIGN DIRECTIONS</span><h3>四个方向，梳理品牌与角色的联系</h3></figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="rb-panel" id="ep-rigging"><header><div><p>02 / RIGGING & PRODUCT APPLICATION</p><h2>从平面形象，到有表情的三维角色。</h2><p class="rb-description">用圆润体块与鲜明色彩延续角色识别，将嘴部、眼睛和肢体姿态转化为丰富的情绪表达。绑定展示与吃货卡界面放在同一图板中，连接角色表现和产品场景。</p></div></header><figure class="ep-wide"><img src="<%- asset('rigging') %>" width="2560" height="1440" alt="吃豆人三维绑定、六种姿态与吃货卡手机界面，静态展示图" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>CHARACTER IN USE</span><h3>绑定展示 · 姿态变化 · 界面应用</h3></figcaption></figure></section>
  <section class="rb-panel" id="ep-posters"><header><div><p>03 / CAMPAIGN POSTERS</p><h2>让角色，走进真实的吃货时刻。</h2><p class="rb-description">早餐、下单与下午茶构成三个日常触点。让吃豆人与食物、餐桌和外卖箱共同讲述场景，再以统一的品牌信息区串联整组海报。</p></div></header><div class="ep-posters"><% [{n:'breakfast',label:'早餐时刻',alt:'争分夺秒，但别忘吃早餐呀：吃豆人与早餐餐桌'},{n:'order',label:'下单收豆',alt:'下单就吃货豆，积攒越攒越省钱：吃豆人与外卖箱'},{n:'tea',label:'午后小憩',alt:'超级吃货卡，尽享下午茶：吃豆人与茶点'}].forEach(item => { %><figure><button class="ep-poster-open" type="button" aria-label="查看大图：<%= item.label %>"><img src="<%- asset(item.n) %>" width="2500" height="3359" alt="<%= item.alt %>" loading="lazy"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><figcaption><h3><%= item.label %></h3></figcaption></figure><% }); %></div><figure class="ep-wide ep-mockup"><img src="<%- asset('posters') %>" width="2560" height="1440" alt="三张吃货卡海报的线下广告展示效果" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>POSTER DISPLAY</span><h3>从单幅传播到系列化展示</h3></figcaption></figure></section>
  <section class="rb-panel" id="ep-extension"><header><div><p>04 / VISUAL EXTENSION</p><h2>不止会吃豆，也懂享受生活。</h2><p class="rb-description">把吃货豆变成沙发旁的“爆米花”和包围角色的金色豆海。用紫蓝撞色与明亮黄色扩展角色的情绪空间，让同一形象在不同场景中保持鲜活。</p></div></header><div class="ep-stack"><figure><img src="<%- asset('sofa') %>" width="2560" height="1440" alt="吃豆人在紫色沙发上抱着装满吃货豆的爆米花桶" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>LEISURE TIME</span><h3>把快乐，装进一桶吃货豆</h3></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="<%- asset('beans') %>" width="2560" height="1440" alt="蓝色吃豆人开心地躺在金色吃货豆中" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>A WORLD OF BEANS</span><h3>掉进吃货豆的快乐世界</h3></figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <footer class="rb-footer"><div><span>ELE.ME / CHARACTER & VISUAL SYSTEM</span><p>从一个角色，延展出一组可识别的品牌场景。</p></div><a href="<%- url_for(page.portfolio_home || '/visual-designer/') %>">← 返回作品集</a></footer>
</article>

<dialog class="ep-lightbox" aria-label="吃货卡海报大图" data-lenis-prevent>
  <button class="ep-lightbox-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭大图">×</button>
  <button class="ep-lightbox-prev" type="button" aria-label="上一张">‹</button>
  <figure><img alt=""><figcaption aria-live="polite"></figcaption></figure>
  <button class="ep-lightbox-next" type="button" aria-label="下一张">›</button>
</dialog>
<script src="<%- url_for('js/eleme-pacman.js') %>" defer></script>
